        "modelingNotes": [
          "Manufacturer spelling LC1D38BD; source LC1-D38BD retained in orderNumber. B8/8 selection and BD suffix corroborate exact identity; no substitution.",
          "AC-3 38 A and AC-1 50 A at <=440 V AC, <=60 degrees C. Power voltage capability <=690 V AC at 25–400 Hz or <=300 V DC; these are not assigned circuit voltages.",
          "24 V DC standard coil, 5.4 W at 20 degrees C; built-in bidirectional peak-limiting diode suppressor. Suppression is documented within coil abstraction, with transient behavior unmodeled and no fixed link.",
          "Terminal diagram: https://iportal2.schneider-electric.com/Contents/docs/B8_CONTACTORS_EN_CATALOGUE.PDF B8/79 diagram 127266, applicable via B8/8. Markings preserved including 13/NO and 21/NC.",
          "FA121938 https://www.se.com/ca/en/faqs/FA121938/ directs A1 positive and A2 negative. FA95490 https://www.se.com/us/en/faqs/FA95490/ confirms one connection each; no duplicated A2.",
          "All contact functions are mechanically actuated by the coil; no coil, contact or suppressor creates a permanent net. Passive contacts are application-dependent; A1/A2 are required by library policy for electrical coil operation. Optional accessories excluded."
        ]
      },
